    "html": "<p>The mass of a Planet A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"M\"></span>, its radius is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"R\"></span> and the escape speed from Planet A is <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"v\"></span>. Planet B has four times the mass and half the radius of Planet A. What is the escape speed from Planet B?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8v\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\sqrt{8} v\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{8}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{v}{\\sqrt{8}}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
